# Shaft one is tied to every treadle, so the ends on shaft one are raised over every
# pick and are never woven in. The cloth reads as sound in every other way, which is
# why the quality report looks for this rather than leaving it to the eye.
name Floating End
shafts 4
treadles 4
threading straight 8
tieup 12 13 14 1
treadling straight 8
